    {
      "identifier": "cementite_prescher_2012_figure1_digitized",
      "kind": "pressure_volume_digitized",
      "description": "The reconstruction uses all 22 digitized Figure 1 markers, including the ambient marker, with equal pressure weights and adopted V0 fixed. K0 and K0_prime are free. Covariance is inverse(J^T J) times SSE/(22-2); its errors condition on exact V0 and omit V0 uncertainty. The result is K0=160.757426 +/-2.353365 GPa and K0_prime=5.942125 +/-0.219843, which round to 161+/-2 and 5.9+/-0.2. Digitization/calibration errors are correlated and original experimental errors are unknown. The 19 final Table S1 rows remain a separate complete numeric dataset; three graph markers are absent from it. Published low/high split fits are retained only in the research audit, not offered as public EOS records.",
